INT. COUNTY COURTHOUSE - COURTROOM 3B - DAY

A cramped room under a failing skylight. Radiators clank.

JUDGE IMELDA CARDENAS, sixties, silver braid, presides. WENDELL PRATT, fifties, rumpled prosecutor. SOO-JIN HAN, thirties, sharp defense counsel in a navy suit. In the box, BARTHOLOMEW "BARTY" QUILL, seventies, a retired beekeeper in a borrowed tie.

SOO-JIN
Mr. Quill, you've kept bees how long?

BARTY
Fifty-one years, Ms. Han.

WENDELL
Objection. Relevance.

JUDGE CARDENAS
Mr. Pratt, you've been relevant to nothing since lunch. Overruled.

WENDELL
Your Honor, with respect--

JUDGE CARDENAS
I said overruled, Wendell.

SOO-JIN
Mr. Quill, on the night of the fourteenth, you saw a van near the apiary.

BARTY
Gray van. No plates. Engine running.

WENDELL
Leading!

SOO-JIN
He's describing, Your Honor.

JUDGE CARDENAS
He is describing. Sit, Mr. Pratt.

WENDELL
I am sitting, Judge.

JUDGE CARDENAS
You are hovering. Sit lower.

BARTY
Can I say something about the bees?

SOO-JIN
Please, Barty.

WENDELL
Mr. Quill, you don't have to--

BARTY
I want to. They go quiet when strangers come. That night, they went quiet at ten, not nine. Somebody was at the hive an hour before the van.

SOO-JIN
An hour before.

BARTY
Right, Ms. Han. Which means the van wasn't the first.

WENDELL
That's speculation.

JUDGE CARDENAS
It's beekeeping, Wendell, and it's more than you've given me all week.

SOO-JIN
Mr. Quill, who else keeps hives within a mile?

BARTY
Just the Pellegrino boy and me.

WENDELL
Your Honor, this is a fishing expedition.

JUDGE CARDENAS
It is a honey expedition, and I'll allow it.

SOO-JIN
And the Pellegrino boy, Barty, does he drive a gray van?

BARTY
He drives a bicycle.

WENDELL
Thank you!

BARTY
But his uncle drives a gray van.

WENDELL
Objection!

JUDGE CARDENAS
Overruled. Go on, Mr. Quill.

BARTY
Uncle Dario. Owes me forty dollars since March.

SOO-JIN
Nothing further, Your Honor.

JUDGE CARDENAS
Mr. Pratt, cross?

WENDELL
(a long pause)
Mr. Quill, about that forty dollars.

BARTY
Yes, Mr. Pratt?

WENDELL
You hold a grudge, don't you?

BARTY
I hold bees, Mr. Pratt. Grudges just sting.

JUDGE CARDENAS
Court is in recess until two. Ms. Han, bring me honey.

SOO-JIN
Your Honor?

JUDGE CARDENAS
Jar of it. My cold's back.
